                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last week, our office joined Antelope Valley Partners for Health for their monthly briefing.\n\nThey heard from Kaliah of Three Heart Connections, who shared how the first Junior Thrivers fellowship is helping AV high school students build skills to support their mental health.\n\nGrateful to see organizations across our community working together to share knowledge, build partnerships, and strengthen support for families in the Antelope Valley.",
                "text_lang": "en",
