                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today I joined @rosadelauro and @SenGillibrand to introduce the FAMILY Act! Just 27% of Americans have paid family leave through their jobs, and this bill would create a national program that helps meet the needs of new parents and people with serious personal or family health issues. The FAMILY Act will benefit working parents, children, and businesses alike.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": [
                    "rosadelauro",
                    "SenGillibrand"
                ],
