                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Our office joined the Palmdale Women\u2019s Club last week to hear from AQMNI\u2019s husband and wife duo Ethel, and Carlo, who shared how their community mural projects in the Antelope Valley engage youth, cultivate creativity, and use art to support mental health.\n\nWe\u2019re grateful to have artists in our community who use their creativity to heal, inspire, and bring people together.",
