                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "A nurse, cancer survivor, and mother from our district shared the many ways she depends on Affordable Care Act tax credits/ Without an extension, she\u2019ll lose access to the care that keeps her alive.\n\nWe have a responsibility to protect affordable, accessible health care for her, and for every family who depends on it.",
