                "text": "This goes beyond politics or policy. The United States has been entrusted with immense resources, and with that comes a responsibility to protect the most vulnerable. Cutting life-saving global health aid is already costing thousands of lives, including children, and risks worsening infectious disease that could spread to our country. \n\nAs a Christian, I believe our responsibility to one another does not stop at borders. Restoring PEPFAR and other public health programs isn\u2019t just the smart choice, it\u2019s the right thing to do. We must act now to save lives.",
